#: plugins/example.desktop:7
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Example Parley Script"
msgstr "Guión Parley d'exemplu"

#: plugins/example.desktop:54
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"This example script offers two actions: 1) Move selected vocabulary to a "
"different lesson 2) Change the grade of selected words to known (highest "
"grade)"
msgstr ""
"Esti guión d'exemplu ufre dos aiciones: 1) Mover el vocabulariu esbilláu a "
"otra lleición 2) Cambiar el nivel de les pallabres esbillaes a conocíu "
"(nivel más altu)"

