msgstr "Usa'l diccionariu de Google (translate.google.com) pa tornar pallabres"

#: plugins/google_images.desktop:7
msgctxt "Name"
msgid "Google Images (online image fetching)"
msgstr "Imaxes de Google (algamar imaxes en llinia)"

#: plugins/google_images.desktop:52
#, fuzzy
#| msgctxt "Comment"
#| msgid ""
#| "This script automatically fetches images from images.google.com for the "
#| "selected word.  The search language depends on the selected word.  "
#| "Downloaded images are stored in a <<document file name>>_files folder "
#| "next to the document file. Requires PyQt4."
msgctxt "Comment"
msgid ""
"This script automatically fetches images from images.google.com for the "
"selected word. The search language depends on the selected word. Downloaded "
"images are stored in a <em>document file name</em>_files folder next to the "
"document file. Requires PyQt4."
msgstr ""
"Esti guión obtién automáticamente les imáxenes de images.google.com pa la "
"pallabra esbillada. La llingua de gueta depende de la pallabra esbillada. "
"Les imáxenes descargaes atróxense nuna carpeta <<nome de ficheru del "
"documentu>>_files xunto col ficheru del documentu. Necesita PyQt4."

